      "snippet_id": "SNP-001",
      "snippet_text": "> \"[Gateway name] payments are processed instantly, so you receive funds immediately after each transaction. [Gateway name] payments work a little differently compared to Stripe or PayPal on Payhip. You will get your full payment (without Payhip fees deducted) instantly after each transaction has been processed. At the end of each month, you'll be billed for your Payhip fees using your preferred credit card.\"",
